{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "63c8346e-7571-823a-a0e0-1a288f8a8fe1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T12:32:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, parking violations, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Janet. Isabel Correia. I got a parking ticket yesterday and I think it was written by mistake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, yeah. Hang on, there's a vacuum running in the other room. Let me shut that off so I can hear you. [pause] Okay, sorry. The number is, it's got a letter first, then 4, 4, 1, 9, 0, 7."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have it here. It was issued for parking in a resident-permit-only space. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what it says. But I have the resident sticker. It's on the windshield, driver's side, bottom corner. It's been there since the fall. I went back out and looked, and it's right there, plain as day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Because the ticket is already issued, the proper way to handle that is to file an appeal. You would include the ticket number and a photograph showing the sticker displayed on the vehicle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I do that by email, or do I have to come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You may bring it to the office or mail it in. The ticket itself has the appeal instructions printed on the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the back. Let me flip it over. Yep, there it is. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:31:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And, um, one more thing. If the appeal doesn't go my way, is there a payment plan? Like could I pay it off in pieces instead of all at once?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't confirm the details of a payment arrangement from here. If the appeal is denied, you would contact this office and we can go over what options exist for your balance. I would suggest you not ignore the ticket in the meantime, because deadlines do apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:31:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's wicked fair. So appeal first, with the picture, and then call back if I need to work out the payment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. Is there anything else I can help you with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Oh, do you need my number on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is helpful to have it with the appeal, yes. Please include it on your letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Correia. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:32:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Thanks, Janet."
    }
  ],
